    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">1. Introduction & Scope</h2>
    <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 25px;">
      Welcome to <strong>Flutter Hotels & Resorts</strong> ("Hotel", "We", "Us", or "Our"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal data of our guests, website visitors, and customers who book stays or services through our website, phone, WhatsApp, or payment links. This Privacy Policy details how we collect, use, store, and safeguard your information in compliance with applicable Indian privacy laws and digital transaction standards.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      When you make a reservation, submit an enquiry, or interact with our services, we may collect the following information:
    </p>
    <ul style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 25px; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li><strong>Personal Identification Data:</strong> Full Name, Email Address, Contact Phone Number, Postal Address.</li>
      <li><strong>Stay & Booking Information:</strong> Check-in and Check-out dates, room type preference, number of guests, special stay requests.</li>
      <li><strong>Identity Proof (At Check-in):</strong> Government-issued photo ID details (Aadhaar Card, Passport, Driving License, Voter ID) as required by local law enforcement guidelines.</li>
      <li><strong>Payment Transaction Data:</strong> Transaction ID, payment reference numbers, payment mode (Credit/Debit Card, UPI, NetBanking, Wallet). <em>Note: We do not store sensitive card numbers or PINs; all online transactions are securely processed via PCI-DSS compliant payment gateways (such as Razorpay).</em></li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 25px;">
      We use your information solely for legitimate hospitality and business operations, including:
      <br>• Processing your room reservations and sending booking confirmations & receipts.
      <br>• Contacting you regarding check-in assistance, directions, or stay updates.
      <br>• Verifying guest identity upon check-in as mandated by local police authorities.
      <br>• Processing refunds or resolving billing enquiries.
      <br>• Improving our resort facilities, guest services, and website performance.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">4. Data Sharing & Third-Party Disclosure</h2>
    <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 25px;">
      We do NOT sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties. We share data only with:
      <br>• <strong>Payment Gateways (Razorpay):</strong> To securely authorize and complete payment transactions.
      <br>• <strong>Government / Police Authorities:</strong> When required under statutory guest reporting regulations in Uttarakhand, India.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">5. Data Security</h2>
    <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 25px;">
      We employ Industry-standard technical and organizational security measures (SSL encryption, secure server databases, access control) to prevent unauthorized access, disclosure, or alteration of your personal data.
    </p>

